cff-version: 1.2.0
title: FHIR Agent Benchmark
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Murzone
    given-names: Farid
abstract: >-
  An open benchmark for evaluating AI agents on FHIR-native healthcare
  workflows, including structured clinical reasoning, medication reconciliation,
  FHIR resource generation, data-quality detection, safety evaluation, and
  serialization robustness.
keywords:
  - FHIR
  - HL7
  - healthcare AI
  - LLM agents
  - benchmark
  - evaluation
  - clinical reasoning
  - interoperability
version: "0.1"
license: MIT
